## Ownership

| Item | Value |
| --- | --- |
| Tables | `{{.M.Name}}` / `{{.M.Name}}_*` (test/arch rejects SQL on another module's tables) |
| Identifiers | `UUID DEFAULT uuidv7()` primary keys and `UUID` foreign keys; Go code uses `uuid.UUID` and `uuid.NewV7()` when it needs the id before insert |
| Migrations | `migrations/<UTC timestamp>_{{.M.Name}}_<purpose>.{up,down}.sql` |
| Permissions | `{{.M.Name}}:read`, `{{.M.Name}}:write` (admin-only until granted) |
| Error codes | `{{.M.Name}}.not_implemented` |
| Jobs / events / schedules | none |
| Tenant purge | `TenantPurgers` (generated resources append their purger in `build.go`; bootstrap calls it at the `gen:module-purge` marker) |
| Privacy | none until a generated table stores per-user rows (then add `RegisterPrivacy`) |
| Contracts | none (add `internal/contracts/{{.M.Name}}/` when another module needs this one) |

## Routes

| Method | Path | Permission |
| --- | --- | --- |
| GET | `/api/v1/{{.M.Route}}/health` | `{{.M.Name}}:read` |

## Layout

| Path | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `module.go`, `build.go` | composition: `Build(infra, Settings) (*Module, Provides, error)`, routes |
| `catalog/` | permissions, error codes, en/vi strings |
| `service/` | use cases; `ports.go` declares what they need |
| `repository/` + `queries/` + `sqlc/` | PostgreSQL adapter; `sqlc.yaml` is this module's sqlc config |
| `handler/` + `dto/` | HTTP adapter |

